# One Source Integrative Medicine

## Patient-Centered Functional Medicine and Primary Care

[
Learn more
][258]

## One Source Integrative Medicine

### Direct Primary Care, Integrative, Family Medicine practice.

At One Source Integrative Medicine we employ a more personalized, patient centered, whole person
approach to healthcare, rather than a conventional, one size fits all, disease oriented focus.
Whether you are currently healthy and want a partner in maintaining good health, or you are
suffering with chronic pain and want to achieve your best possible health, we foster a proactive,
vested partnership between patient and provider.

## We strive to help heal, educate, and empower our patients.

Through this vested partnership, we strive to help heal, educate, and empower our patients. By
supporting every patient’s personal potential for optimal physical, mental, and emotional health, we
seek to promote and restore wellness throughout one's lifetime.
[Schedule an appointment][259]

## Conditions we treat

Our medical practitioners are dedicated to the health and well-being of the patients, addressing all
of their health concerns holistically: treating their entire mind, body, and spirit. We offer
treatment options for a wide variety of illnesses and conditions to help you feel your best every
day.
[

## ADD/ADHD

Attention-Deficit/Hyperactivity Disorder (ADHD) is a condition that affects a patient's attention
and mood.
][260][

## Allergies

Allergies are symptoms that occur as a response to your immune system overreacting to substances
known as allergens that are harmless in other people.
][261][

## Joint Pain

Joint pain, often caused by conditions such as arthritis, injury, or inflammation, can significantly
impact mobility and quality of life.
][262][

## Back and Neck Pain

Neck and back pain are prevalent issues that can significantly affect an individual’s daily life.
These conditions often stem from degenerative changes, injuries, or chronic strain affecting the
spine's structures.
][263][

## Functional Medicine

Functional medicine practices use a systems biology approach to identify the underlying causes of
disease.
][264][

## Migraines

Migraines are a recurring form of headaches that cause moderate to severe in patients that
experience them. Migraines can result in one or several different types of symptoms.
][265]
[Explore all conditions][266]

## Our Services

## Experience our patient-centered approach today!

Here at One Source Integrative Medicine in Florence SC, we offer a variety of services to help you
achieve optimal wellness and overall health. Our medical practitioners are dedicated to the health
and well-being of the patients, addressing all of their health concerns holistically: treating their
entire mind, body, and spirit. We offer treatment options for a wide variety of illnesses and
conditions to help you feel your best every day. 
